      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "VIENNA ON SHOW (4) was strongly supported last start when a short priced favourite and duly saluted winning by 6 lengths at this track in a handy 24.44. Awkwardly drawn but goes well over this trip. Recorded the quickest time on the card last start. Great chance again. WHY NOT ZACH (3) led throughout to score two back then drifted back and missed the frame latest finishing a 4 length 5th at Warragul (23.16). Form from his last run is proving to be solid. Expected to feature in the finish. POPPER (7) is in great form having scored back to back wins, the latest in the best of the program at Warragul in 26.09. Solid formlines coming through her last run. Significant danger. LETHAL AVENGER (6) placed last start at this track and distance and is in the mix again.",
